#: setup.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to view change activity on the Cacti server.  Administrators can also export the audit log for analysis purposes."
msgstr "Ivumela abaLawuli ukuba bajonge imisebenzi yotshintsho kwiserva ye-Cacti. AbaLawuli banokuthumela ngaphandle ilogi yophicotho ngeenjongo zohlalutyo."

